{"version":1,"content":"<p>雖然《GTA6》目前尚未推出PC版，但藉助採集卡、PC硬件以及英偉達DLSS技術，玩家已經開始嘗試模擬遊戲在PC上的運行效果。近日，GameGPU通過採集PS5 Pro版《GTA6》的畫面，再利用PC端的DLSS技術進行處理和幀生成，展示了這款遊戲未來登陸PC平台後可能呈現的畫面表現。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1587134.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T16:40:46.181433+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T16:17:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T16:33:54.133747+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T16:33:54.133747+00:00","content_hash":"e6f8ac5a2bb8117d3912d52af3dd2e9752591bf4b9977141679b2f4f4c67d702","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}